powerpagecomponent.content:
{
  "description": "Exposes al_outcomecase to the portal Web API so a page can re-read the case's own status after a write a plug-in made on its behalf. Read only: the sole permission on this table is `Outcome Case - read all` (a1000000-...-060, adx_read true and adx_write, adx_create and adx_delete all false), so enabling the Web API here grants the browser nothing it did not already have through OD-022's read-all, and no PATCH can succeed whatever the allowlist below says. Added 2026-09-14 for the AD-094 render cache: a regrade or a sign-off is written by a plug-in, not by the website, so the portal's cache is never invalidated for al_outcomecase and the status badge can go on reading Awaiting Recheck for up to fifteen minutes after the case has Closed. Reported against 254398988 on 2026-09-14, where the case page said Closed and the remediation page said Awaiting Recheck at the same moment - two Liquid queries, two cache entries, one of them stale.",
  "value": "true"
}
